{"id":"tiefe","lemma":"Tiefe","pos":"noun","rank":3355,"glosses":["depth"],"ipa":"/ˈtiːfə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a6/De-Tiefe.ogg/De-Tiefe.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Tiefe","plural":"Tiefen"},"examples":[{"text":"Er hat eine tiefe Stimme.","en":"He has a deep voice.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"voice"}]},{"text":"Er fiel in einen tiefen Schlaf.","en":"He fell into a deep sleep.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to fall, to drop","l":"fallen"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"sleep"}]},{"text":"Sie nahm einen tiefen Atemzug.","en":"She took a deep breath.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/469768","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to take","l":"nehmen"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"breath"}]},{"text":"Im Leben gibt es Höhen und Tiefen.","en":"In life there are ups and downs.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/809","words":[{"g":"in the"},{"g":"a state in which…"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"height, altitude","l":"Höhe"},{"g":"and"},null]},{"text":"Wir haben die Tiefe des Flusses gemessen.","en":"We measured the depth of the river.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"of the","l":"der"},{"g":"river","l":"Fluss"},{"g":"to measure","l":"messen"}]}]}